  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>As bond length increases, bond energy decreases.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 400px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><strong>Bond</strong></td>\t\t\t<td><strong>Bond energy (kJ mol<sup>-1</sup>)</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C - C</td>\t\t\t<td>348</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>Si - Si</td>\t\t\t<td>297</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>Ge - Ge</td>\t\t\t<td>260</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>Sn - Sn</td>\t\t\t<td>240</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>So, bond enthalpy order&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Si</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Si</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Ge</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Ge</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Sn</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Sn</mi></math></p>"
